// ESXi Admin Permission Assigned To Account Via ESXCLI | T1059.012, T1098 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/process_creation/proc_creation_lnx_esxcli_permission_change_admin.yml
DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "/esxcli" and ProcessCommandLine contains "system" and (ProcessCommandLine contains " permission " and ProcessCommandLine contains " set" and ProcessCommandLine contains "Admin")
